Package: scrcpydex
Version: 2.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgl1, udev, adb, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Recommends: va-driver-all | intel-media-va-driver | mesa-va-drivers
Maintainer: ScrcpyDeX Contributors <contributors@scrcpydex.local>
Homepage: https://github.com/Aureliano021/ScrcpyDex
Description: Open-source client for Samsung DeX on PC via USB or Wi-Fi
 ScrcpyDeX enables Samsung DeX desktop mode over USB or Wi-Fi (ADB wireless
 pairing) using scrcpy display streaming and Samsung framework activation.
 Features low-latency display forwarding, native UHID mouse integration,
 dual-mode screen mirroring fallback, and automated session teardown.
